26-05-13.21:26:50.807 [main            ] INFO  AiAgentAutoConfigTest  - 测试结果:["```java\nimport java.net.HttpURLConnection;\nimport java.net.URL;\nimport java.util.Scanner;\nimport java.io.BufferedReader;\nimport java.io.InputStreamReader;\n\npublic class WeatherForecast {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        try {\n            // 获取用户所在地的经纬度（这里假设使用百度地图API，实际使用时需替换为你的API密钥和相关参数）\n            String location = getLocation();\n            String[] latLng = getLatLng(location);\n\n            // 根据经纬度获取明天的天气信息（这里假设使用心知天气API，实际使用时需替换为你的API密钥和相关参数）\n            String apiKey = \"YOUR_XINZHITIANQI_API_KEY\";\n            String weatherInfo = getWeatherInfo(apiKey, latLng[0], latLng[1]);\n\n            System.out.println(\"明天的天气情况：\" + weatherInfo);\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static String getLocation() throws Exception {\n        String url = \"https://api.map.baidu.com/location/ip?ak=YOUR_BAIDU_MAP_API_KEY\";\n        HttpURLConnection connection = (HttpURLConnection) new URL(url).openConnection();\n        connection.setRequestMethod(\"GET\");\n\n        BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(connection.getInputStream()));\n        String inputLine;\n        StringBuilder response = new StringBuilder();\n\n        while ((inputLine = in.readLine()) != null) {\n            response.append(inputLine);\n        }\n        in.close();\n\n        // 从响应中提取位置信息\n        // 这里需要根据百度地图API的响应格式进行解析\n        // 示例解析代码：\n        int startIndex = response.indexOf(\"\\\"address\\\":\");\n        int endIndex = response.indexOf(\",\", startIndex);\n        return response.substring(startIndex + 10, endIndex - 1);\n    }\n\n    private static String[] getLatLng(String location) throws Exception {\n        String url = \"https://api.map.baidu.com/geocoding/v3/?address=\" + location + \"&output=json&ak=YOUR_BAIDU_MAP_API_KEY\";\n        HttpURLConnection connection = (HttpURLConnection) new URL(url).openConnection();\n        connection.setRequestMethod(\"GET\");\n\n        BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(connection.getInputStream()));\n        String inputLine;\n        StringBuilder response = new StringBuilder();\n\n        while ((inputLine = in.readLine()) != null) {\n            response.append(inputLine);\n        }\n        in.close();\n\n        // 从响应中提取经纬度信息\n        // 这里需要根据百度地图API的响应格式进行解析\n        // 示例解析代码：\n        int startLatIndex = response.indexOf(\"\\\"lat\\\":\");\n        int endLatIndex = response.indexOf(\",\", startLatIndex);\n        String lat = response.substring(startLatIndex + 6, endLatIndex);\n\n        int startLngIndex = response.indexOf(\"\\\"lng\\\":\");\n        int endLngIndex = response.indexOf(\",\", startLngIndex);\n        String lng = response.substring(startLngIndex + 6, endLngIndex);\n\n        return new String[]{lat, lng};\n    }\n\n    private static String getWeatherInfo(String apiKey, String lat, String lng) throws Exception {\n        String url = \"https://api.seniverse.com/v3/weather/forecast.json?key=\" + apiKey + \"&location=\" + lat + \",\" + lng + \"&language=zh-Hans&unit=c&start=0&days=1\";\n        HttpURLConnection connection = (HttpURLConnection) new URL(url).openConnection();\n        connection.setRequestMethod(\"GET\");\n\n        BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(connection.getInputStream()));\n        String inputLine;\n        StringBuilder response = new StringBuilder();\n\n        while ((inputLine = in.readLine()) != null) {\n            response.append(inputLine);\n        }\n        in.close();\n\n        // 从响应中提取明天的天气信息\n        // 这里需要根据心知天气API的响应格式进行解析\n        // 示例解析代码：\n        int startIndex = response.indexOf(\"\\\"text_day\\\":\\\"\");\n        int endIndex = response.indexOf(\"\\\"\", startIndex + 10);\n        return response.substring(startIndex + 10, endIndex);\n    }\n}\n```\n请注意：\n1. 代码中使用的百度地图API和心知天气API部分需要你替换为自己真实的API密钥和相关参数。\n2. 实际使用中可能需要根据具体API的文档调整解析代码来准确获取所需信息。 ","- **Correctness**:\n  - The code has a logical structure to retrieve weather information based on location. However, it currently won't work as the API keys are placeholders. Once the correct keys are inserted, the functionality should be correct based on the given logic.\n- **Readability**:\n  - The code is generally clear and follows a reasonable structure. Each method has a single responsibility which is good for readability. However, the hardcoded index values for parsing the API responses make the code a bit brittle. It would be better to use more descriptive variable names or constants for those indices.\n- **Efficiency**:\n  - There are potential performance bottlenecks. Making multiple network requests (to get location, lat/lng, and weather) without proper error handling and resource management. Also, the way the responses are read line by line into a `StringBuilder` and then parsed might not be the most efficient for large responses.\n- **Edge Cases**:\n  - The code doesn't handle many edge cases well. For example, what if the network requests fail? Currently, it just prints a stack trace. It should handle different types of errors gracefully and provide more meaningful feedback to the user. Also, incorrect API responses (due to wrong keys or changes in API format) are not properly accounted for.\n- **Best Practices**:\n  - The code doesn't fully follow best practices. It would be better to use a more modern and concise way of handling network requests, like using `HttpClient` from Java 11+. Also, the use of magic strings for API URLs and parsing indices goes against the principle of maintainability. Using constants or configuration files for API keys and parsing logic would be much better. ","```java\nimport java.io.BufferedReader;\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.io.InputStreamReader;\nimport java.net.HttpURLConnection;\nimport java.net.URL;\nimport java.net.http.HttpClient;\nimport java.net.http.HttpRequest;\nimport java.net.http.HttpResponse;\nimport java.util.HashMap;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\npublic class WeatherForecast {\n\n    // API endpoints and keys (should be moved to a configuration file in a real scenario)\n    private static final String BAIDU_MAP_LOCATION_API = \"https://api.map.baidu.com/location/ip\";\n    private static final String BAIDU_MAP_API_KEY = \"YOUR_BAIDU_MAP_API_KEY\";\n    private static final String BAIDU_MAP_GEOCODING_API = \"https://api.map.baidu.com/geocoding/v3\";\n    private static final String SENIVERSE_WEATHER_API = \"https://api.seniverse.com/v3/weather/forecast.json\";\n    private static final String SENIVERSE_API_KEY = \"YOUR_SENIVERSE_API_KEY\";\n\n    // Response parsing constants\n    private static final String ADDRESS_KEY = \"address\";\n    private static final String LAT_KEY = \"lat\";\n    private static final String LNG_KEY = \"lng\";\n    private static final String TEXT_DAY_KEY = \"text_day\";\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        try {\n            String location = getLocation();\n            String[] latLng = getLatLng(location);\n            String weatherInfo = getWeatherInfo(latLng[0], latLng[1]);\n            System.out.println(\"明天的天气情况：\" + weatherInfo);\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            handleError(e);\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static String getLocation() throws IOException, InterruptedException {\n        HttpClient client = HttpClient.newHttpClient();\n        HttpRequest request = HttpRequest.newBuilder()\n               .uri(URI.create(BAIDU_MAP_LOCATION_API + \"?ak=\" + BAIDU_MAP_API_KEY))\n               .GET()\n               .build();\n        HttpResponse<String> response = client.send(request, HttpResponse.BodyHandlers.ofString());\n        return parseLocation(response.body());\n    }\n\n    private static String[] getLatLng(String location) throws IOException, InterruptedException {\n        HttpClient client = HttpClient.newHttpClient();\n        HttpRequest request = HttpRequest.newBuilder()\n               .uri(URI.create(BAIDU_MAP_GEOCODING_API + \"?address=\" + location + \"&output=json&ak=\" + BAIDU_MAP_API_KEY))\n               .GET()\n               .build();\n        HttpResponse<String> response = client.send(request, HttpResponse.BodyHandlers.ofString());\n        return parseLatLng(response.body());\n    }\n\n    private static String getWeatherInfo(String lat, String lng) throws IOException, InterruptedException {\n        HttpClient client = HttpClient.newHttpClient();\n        HttpRequest request = HttpRequest.newBuilder()\n               .uri(URI.create(SENIVERSE_WEATHER_API + \"?key=\" + SENIVERSE_API_KEY + \"&location=\" + lat + \",\" + lng + \"&language=zh-Hans&unit=c&start=0&days=1\"))\n               .GET()\n               .build();\n        HttpResponse<String> response = client.send(request, HttpResponse.BodyHandlers.ofString());\n        return parseWeatherInfo(response.body());\n    }\n\n    private static String parseLocation(String response) {\n        Map<String, String> jsonMap = parseJson(response);\n        return jsonMap.get(ADDRESS_KEY);\n    }\n\n    private static String[] parseLatLng(String response) {\n        Map<String, String> jsonMap = parseJson(response);\n        return new String[]{jsonMap.get(LAT_KEY), jsonMap.get(LNG_KEY)};\n    }\n\n    private static String parseWeatherInfo(String response) {\n        Map<String, String> jsonMap = parseJson(response);\n        return jsonMap.get(TEXT_DAY_KEY);\n    }\n\n    private static Map<String, String> parseJson(String json) {\n        Map<String, String> map = new HashMap<>();\n        try (BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(new java.io.ByteArrayInputStream(json.getBytes())))) {\n            String line;\n            while ((line = reader.readLine()) != null) {\n                if (line.contains(\":\\\"\")) {\n                    String[] parts = line.split(\":\\\"\");\n                    String key = parts[0].replaceAll(\"\\\"\", \"\");\n                    String value = parts[1].split(\"\\\"\")[0];\n                    map.put(key, value);\n                }\n            }\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            e.printStackTrace();\n        }\n        return map;\n    }\n\n    private static void handleError(Exception e) {\n        System.err.println(\"获取天气信息失败: \" + e.getMessage());\n    }\n}\n```"]
